%% of Moab (5:22, "these words the LORD spoke... and He added no more"),
%% bound by the covenant sworn in blood (Exod 24:8; renewed 29章), with the
%% Jordan still ahead — Moses will see the land but not cross into it
%% (34:1-4). Gold-bordered, matching series palette.
