%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話" spread built on the Shema (6:4-5), the book's
%% own theological center and, per Jesus, the greatest commandment
%% (Mark 12:29-30) — the same role Job 42:5-6 and Acts 1:8 play in the
%% sister volumes.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{StoneGray} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\fontsize{16}{19}\selectfont\itshape\color{JordanBlue} שְׁמַע יִשְׂרָאֵל}\quad
{\footnotesize\scshape\color{CommentaryBrown} “Shema Yisrael”}

\vspace{0.22cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
以色列阿，你要\textbf{\color{CovenantCrimson}聽}！耶和華─我們神是獨一的主。\\
你要盡心、盡性、盡力\textbf{\color{CovenantCrimson}愛}耶和華─你的神。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
Hear, O Israel! The LORD is our God, the LORD is \textbf{one}!\\
You shall \textbf{love} the LORD your God with all your heart\\
and with all your soul and with all your might.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{StoneGray} 申命記 6:4-5 \textperiodcentered\ Deuteronomy 6:4-5
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 三十四章 \textperiodcentered\ 五卷 \textperiodcentered\ 一句在摩押平原重申的誡命\\
\textit{Thirty-four chapters \textperiodcentered\ five volumes \textperiodcentered\ one commandment renewed on the plains of Moab}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.8cm}p{2.4cm}p{6.9cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{段落} & \textbf{章節} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
曠野路程的回顧 & 1-4章 & 摩西回顧四十年曠野路——不是為了懷舊，是要新一代承接上一代未竟的信心 \\
總綱誡命 & 5-11章 & 十誡重申，繼而是舍瑪與盡心愛神的呼召——一切律例典章的根基先於細則 \\
律例典章 & 12-26章 & 敬拜、審判、聖潔、群體生活的具體條例——把總綱落實到日常的每一個角落 \\
立約更新：祝福與咒詛 & 27-30章 & 示劍宣讀祝福與咒詛，摩押重新立約——選擇擺在面前，是生命還是死亡 \\
摩西的末了 & 31-34章 & 約書亞受託，摩西之歌，為十二支派祝福，最終死在尼波山，望見卻不得進入 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{StoneGray} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一份古代條例的清單，是來聽一位即將離世的領袖，向他所愛卻進不去的百姓，
說出最後、也最迫切的一段話。\\
若你讀完三十四章卻只記得「一堆律法」——請從頭再讀，\\
這次留意：這是愛的呼籲，不是冷冰冰的規條；是「你要選擇」，不是「你別無選擇」。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
You are not reading a list of ancient statutes — you are listening to a dying
leader give his last, most urgent words to a people he loves but will not
enter the land with.\\
If after thirty-four chapters you remember only "a pile of laws," read it again.\\
This time notice: this is a summons to love, not a cold list of rules — it is
"choose," not "you have no choice."}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

